 floor from 0 to −0.25 / +0.25 and required 2 agreeing snapshots instead of 3. That would have allowed 2 of T’s 3 live trades (the UP fill at I=−0.25 would still be blocked). Expected rate approaches T’s when the book is not strongly opposed (T’s 18-day backtest is ~10 trades/day / +$115 at $5; live T has been quieter)."}],"coinbase_lag":{"reachable":true,"samples":900,"last_price":56168.25,"last_diff_bp":-1.9384,"mean_abs_bp":5.8571},"btc_minutes":{"as_of":"9:23:05 PM PT","source":"BRTI","last":56171.26,"series":[{"ts":1795235040,"t":"8:24 PM","c":55736.46,"d":2.14,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795235100,"t":"8:25 PM","c":55699.58,"d":-36.88,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795235160,"t":"8:26 PM","c":55714.42,"d":14.84,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795235220,"t":"8:27 PM","c":55724.71,"d":10.29,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795235280,"t":"8:28 PM","c":55696.55,"d":-28.16,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795235340,"t":"8:29 PM","c":55675.43,"d":-21.12,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795235400,"t":"8:30 PM","c":55666.57,"d":-8.86,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795235460,"t":"8:31 PM","c":55865.95,"d":199.38,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795235520,"t":"8:32 PM","c":55993.06,"d":127.11,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795235580,"t":"8:33 PM","c":55907.41,"d":-85.65,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795235640,"t":"8:34 PM","c":56010.65,"d":103.24,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795235700,"t":"8:35 PM","c":56128.35,"d":117.7,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795235760,"t":"8:36 PM","c":56067.68,"d":-60.67,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795235820,"t":"8:37 PM","c":55962.69,"d":-104.99,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795235880,"t":"8:38 PM","c":55987.47,"d":24.78,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795235940,"t":"8:39 PM","c":55914.76,"d":-72.71,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795236000,"t":"8:40 PM","c":55854.95,"d":-59.81,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795236060,"t":"8:41 PM","c":55990.74,"d":135.79,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795236120,"t":"8:42 PM","c":55900.48,"d":-90.26,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795236180,"t":"8:43 PM","c":55784.61,"d":-115.87,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795236240,"t":"8:44 PM","c":55873.75,"d":89.14,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795236300,"t":"8:45 PM","c":55943.38,"d":69.63,"di